// # oogateway package
//
// Logline: Canonical catalog package anchor for oogateway (layers/L6-cloud).
//
// Setup: Folder shape is manifest plus payload (oogateway.oo).
//
// Beats:
//   1. manifest — name, version, caps, sha256 of oogateway.oo.
